              "expan": "קהל"
            },
            "speaker_before_reference": true
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s125",
                "printed_page": "48",
                "text": "The fearful day of reckoning has arrived. All flesh is full of dread of reprimand. They approach to bend the knee before Him, to purify their thoughts as in the flame of the altar. He who has formed the heart of all of them together, judges so that rich and poor alike are judged according to the scales. He remembers him who said: ‘Will He not do justice?’ His valued prayer will be recalled in judgment. Before He formed any creature, he had planned that rock from which we were hewn (Abraham). Central between past and future",
                "page_start": true
              }
